Package: duckknit
Title: A 'knitr' Engine for the 'DuckDB' CLI
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "rundel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a 'knitr' chunk engine that interfaces with the
    'DuckDB' command-line interface (<https://duckdb.org/>). Chunks can
    target specific database files and maintain persistent sessions across
    chunks within a document. The 'DuckDB' CLI is external software and
    must be installed separately.
URL: https://rundel.github.io/duckknit/,
    https://github.com/rundel/duckknit
BugReports: https://github.com/rundel/duckknit/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    htmltools,
    knitr,
    processx,
    tibble
Suggests:
    cli,
    quarto,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: DuckDB CLI (>= 0.8.0) <https://duckdb.org/>
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
